//! Read-only metadata of the active Protos runtime.
//!
//! `info()` answers a fresh frozen ordinary Object, delegating to `Object`,
//! with exactly five String slots: `implementation`, `implementationVersion`,
//! `engineVersion`, `platform`, and `executionMode`. Every value is observed
//! from the currently entered Context when `info()` is called; nothing is
//! read at import time.
//!
//! Importing this module grants no debugging, host access, foreign access,
//! or inspection authority.

/// Answers a fresh frozen snapshot of the active Protos runtime metadata.
///
/// `info()` accepts no arguments. Any argument, or unavailable runtime
/// metadata, signals a fresh ordinary Error; no partial snapshot escapes.
info: ((facility) => (...arguments) => {
    // D203: forwarding the complete supplied vector keeps the facility's
    // exact zero-argument check.
    facility.info(...arguments)
})(_runtimeMetadataFacility)

// The runtime-provisioned facility is captured privately above; it is not
// module surface.
context.removeSlot("_runtimeMetadataFacility")
